              "text": "कमज़ोरी (kamzorī) — \"weakness\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "It opens on the कम you know, \"little\": weakness is having little strength. कमज़ोरी (kamzorī) लग रही है — \"I feel weak\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
