          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "कमज़ोरी (kamzorī) is a loan, usually traced to Persian kamzor, \"weak\". It is built from kam, \"little\", and zor, \"strength\", with -ī making a noun."
            }
          ]
        },
